<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cone of Shards</h1>
<p>Sphere: Summoning Sphere
Class: Conjurer (guild level 32)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast cone of shards &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast cone of shards</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>Summons a cone of sharp shards that tears into the target. The better your 
magic and your summoning sphere, the harder it strikes. It does about as well 
against any armour, plate and chain included, a little better against 
clothes, and a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. It is also found on scrolls.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Energy Bolt</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clenched Fist</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Summoning Sphere</a>
</pre>




</div>